            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Pericles' Early Life</strong><br>\nPericles was born around 495 BC in Athens, Greece. He came from a wealthy and influential family, which allowed him to receive an excellent education. His father, Xanthippus, was a famous Athenian military commander, and his mother, Agariste, was a member of the powerful and culturally influential Alcmaeonidae family. This background set Pericles up for a path of leadership and public service in Athens.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Athenian Democracy</strong><br>\nPericles is often associated with the development and refinement of the Athenian democracy. During his political career, he worked on reforms that expanded democracy and increased the power of the assembly and the courts. He promoted the idea that all citizens should have an equal opportunity to serve the state and participate in the government, which was a radical concept at the time.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Pericles as a Strategist</strong><br>\nAs a military strategist, Pericles was known for his conservative approach to warfare. He avoided risky battles and instead focused on strengthening Athens's naval power, which was crucial to the city's influence and security. His strategy during the Peloponnesian War, which included avoiding land battles with Sparta and relying on the navy, reflects this cautious approach.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
